ndex.html` provides a clean, easily deployable quiz template. Reviewing the rules, the changes are straightforward button text edits and do not trigger any major version changes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":125,"Path":"C:\\Users\\CxAdmin\\Desktop\\Exploit\\teacher.html","StartLine":110}}]}
